WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.000
-I'm here with
Dakota Johnson, now!

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:07.701
Dakota, you've been in many,
many movies over the years,

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.934
but I wanted to see
if you're a big enough fan

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.901
that you can just summarize
a movie in just 5 seconds.

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:15.534
It's time to play a game called
"5-Second Summaries."

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:16.667
Here we go.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.033
-♪ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 ♪

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:21.434
-♪ Second ♪
-♪ Summaries ♪

00:00:21.434 --> 00:00:23.133
-All right.
Here's how the game works.

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:24.601
We both have cards.

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:26.834
Each card has the name
of a movie on it.

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:29.601
As soon as you look at the card,
you have 5 seconds

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.834
to describe what it's about,
the best you can,

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.701
and try to make me
guess what it is.

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:35.567
You can't use any words
in the title,

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:38.367
actors' names, or catchphrases.

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:41.934
We're just describing
the plot of the movie.

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:44.200
-Okay.
-Alright.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.567
-I don't have cards,
but I memorized mine, so...

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:50.434
-Oh, wow.
-Because I'm an actor.

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:53.934
-Well, I have my cards because
-Oh, God.

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:55.434
-I'm not an actor.

00:00:55.434 --> 00:00:57.100
Alright, but look. We're going
to take turns, alright?

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.334
You're going to go first
since you memorized yours.

00:00:59.334 --> 00:01:00.667
-Okay.

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:02.133
-Alright. Let's put 5 seconds
on the clock.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:05.601
Whenever you're ready, just say
"go," and we'll start the clock.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.834
-Okay. Are you ready?

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:10.868
-Yes.
-Okay. Go.

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:14.100
This is a film where there's
lots of brothers and sisters

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.267
and they're running
through a field.

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:18.300
-"Sound of Music."
-And they are singing.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.534
-"Sound of Music."

00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:21.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.067
Brothers and sisters
running through a field.

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.167
-Okay.
-Yes, that is correct.

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:28.300
I love that movie.
Alright. Here we go.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.234
As soon as I look,
it's 5 seconds. Alright?

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:33.467
Uh -- Oh.

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:37.167
Gangs, dancing gangs that sing.

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:39.234
-"West Side Story."
-Yes! That's correct!

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.067
Wow. That's good.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.267
I was going to sing, and
then I'm like, "I can't do it."

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:44.801
Right? Alright, yeah.
Alright.

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:47.200
This is fun. Now, your second
one that you memorized,

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.734
say "go" when you're ready.
-Okay.

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:50.901
-Actually, let's make it
a little tougher here.

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.501
Let's put 3 seconds
on the clock.

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:53.701
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:54.901
-Oh [bleep].

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:57.534
-You can't --
-[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.534
You can't say that word
on our show!

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:02.334
-I mean, but we should be able
to say that word now,

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:05.067
like, after all this time.
-No.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:07.334
-Kids aren't awake
when this comes on.

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.934
-Yes, they are. There --
A lot of kids watch our show.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:15.367
Dude, we're, like, the number
one trend on TikTok right now.

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:16.501
Are you kidding me?

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:18.434
-Oh. Sorry.
-Yeah. Yeah -- Oh, yeah.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:21.601
No problem. No problem. Alright.
Whenever you're ready, say "go."

00:02:21.601 --> 00:02:22.767
And then I will -- in 3 --

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:24.400
You have 3 seconds
to describe this movie.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.834
-Okay. Go.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.868
Where's my fish?! Lost fish!

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:32.667
-Oh. "Finding Nemo."

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:35.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:37.300
-"Where's my fish?!"

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.701
That's a great --
That's a great clue.

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:43.734
Alright. 3 seconds. This time,
the pressure's on me now.

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:46.434
Ready? 3 seconds.

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:48.267
[Russian accent]
"Oh, I talk like this.

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:51.033
I make purses and dresses
and fashion."

00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:54.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:56.834
-What?

00:02:56.834 --> 00:03:00.300
-"But I talk like this.
I talk with a little accent.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.300
I make fashion. I make bags."

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.067
-Are you Russian?

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:06.000
-Yeah.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.000
-Do I need --
Do I know this movie?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.968
-Maybe. Yeah, you do.

00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:14.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:16.734
-I don't know it.

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:18.767
-♪ Ra, ra, ooh-la-la ♪

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:21.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:23.934
♪ Ga, ga, ooh-la-la ♪

00:03:23.934 --> 00:03:28.167
This is bad romance.
Bad romance."

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.300
-Bad romance?
What are you talking --

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.067
What is it?

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:35.467
-Father-son,
"House of Gucci."

00:03:35.467 --> 00:03:37.334
-Oh, I haven't seen
that movie yet.

00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:39.968
-[ Sad tuba plays ]
-Also, they're not Russian.

00:03:39.968 --> 00:03:42.200
-I don't know.
It's a -- It's a hit movie.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.634
-Oh, she's Russian.

00:03:43.634 --> 00:03:45.000
-Yes.
-She's Russian.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.601
-Is she?
-That's embarrassing.

00:03:47.601 --> 00:03:49.634
-Was I wrong? Is she Russian?
-No.

00:03:49.634 --> 00:03:53.200
-She's not? She's Italian?
Sorry.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.234
-[ Sad tuba plays ]
-Yeah.

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:58.834
See? That was pretty confusing.

00:03:58.834 --> 00:04:01.801
-Anyway, that's --
No spoilers, no spoilers.

00:04:01.801 --> 00:04:04.234
-It seems like
I should get a point for that.

00:04:04.234 --> 00:04:05.534
-Yeah, you probably should.
Judges?

00:04:05.534 --> 00:04:06.767
-[ Bell dings ]
-That was bad.

00:04:06.767 --> 00:04:08.200
-Alright, they gave you
a point for that one.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:12.234
Oh, my God. Alright. Here we go.
The final round.

00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:14.701
Let's put 1 second
