00:04:14.701 --> 00:04:16.234
Whenever you're ready.
-Okay.

00:04:16.234 --> 00:04:18.467
-Alright. You tell me. 1 second.

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:20.234
-Okay. Go!

00:04:20.234 --> 00:04:22.567
Grumpy green man.

00:04:22.567 --> 00:04:24.968
